# Chapter 13, worked example: a rate table looked up with @VLOOKUP
A1 0
B1 0
A2 10000
B2 .15
A3 30000
B3 .28
A4 60000
B4 .33
D1 12000
E1 @VLOOKUP(D1,A1..B4,1)
D2 60000
E2 @VLOOKUP(D2,A1..B4,1)
D3 5
E3 @VLOOKUP(D3,A1..B4,1)
D4 75000
E4 @VLOOKUP(D4,A1..B4,1)
F1 +D1*E1
do /cf1~f2~/cf1..f2~f3~
show E1
show F1
show E2
show F2
show E3
show F3
show E4
= @INDEX(A1..B4,1,2)
